@baseUrl = https://localhost:7172/api/event
@eventId = 1

### Get all events
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule

### Create an event
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Conference",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T09:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-12-01T17:00:00",
  "maxRegistrations": 100,
  "location": "Tel Aviv"
}

### Get an event
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{eventId}}

### Register a user to an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{eventId}}/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01"
}

### Get event participants
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{eventId}}/registration

### Get the weather forecast for an event
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{eventId}}/weather
